 # [ActionItem(task='Send the revised quote to Halden', owner='Ana Ruiz', due=date(2026, 3, 6))]
 ```
 
+The list is capped at 10. `extract_action_items` returns only that list; to know whether the cap cut anything, call `extract_with_overflow`, which returns an `Extraction` with `items` (the capped list), `omitted` (the valid items the cap cut, in list order) and `complete` (`True` when nothing was cut). Show the user a warning, and the omitted items, whenever `complete` is `False`.
+
 Run the tests from this directory with `python -m unittest`.
